# Legal

- Site legal pages are on this domain (`/impressum`, `/datenschutz`, `/cookies` and `en/` / `ru/` twins). Edit `src/lib/legal.ts`, not bifode.org.
- `LINKS.impressum` / `LINKS.datenschutz` are the Verein pages on bifode.org. Keep that distinction in the footer of `Legal.astro`.
- Forms need `PrivacyCheck` and must not POST without the privacy checkbox. Honeypot field `website` stays in the parser.
- German `.de` launch needs Impressum and Datenschutz. Do not redirect those paths off-site again.
- Binding language for legal text is German; ru/en are aids. If you change a legal fact (address, email, purposes), update all three locales.
